The '''Enrager''' is an {{Epic}} [[Swords|Sword]] that could be obtained from [[Kuudra]] Reward Chests.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Enrager''' is currently unobtainable. It could previously appear in Paid Reward Chests after defeating [[Kuudra]].

